[E0413] Error: `count` is passed together with a `&var` reference to it
    ╭─[ err/270_work_that_borrows/main.wip:12:41 ]
    │
 12 │     future::together(() => { count += 1 }, () => count)
    │                      ──────────┬─────────  ─────┬─────
    │                                ╰──────────────────────── a `&var` reference
    │                                                 │
    │                                                 ╰─────── a `&` reference
    │
    │ Note: while a function runs, a `&var` argument must be the only reference to its place
────╯
[E0413] Error: `count` is passed as `&var` together with another reference to it
    ╭─[ err/270_work_that_borrows/main.wip:13:41 ]
    │
 13 │     future::together(() => { count += 1 }, () => { count += 2 })
    │                      ──────────┬─────────  ──────────┬─────────
    │                                ╰───────────────────────────────── a `&var` reference
    │                                                      │
    │                                                      ╰─────────── a `&var` reference
    │
    │ Note: while a function runs, a `&var` argument must be the only reference to its place
────╯
[E0404] Error: cannot copy `flag`
    ╭─[ err/270_work_that_borrows/main.wip:16:15 ]
    │
 16 │     val copied = flag
    │                  ──┬─
    │                    ╰─── `flag` has type `Atomic<bool>`
    │
    │ Help: to transfer ownership, write `move flag`
    │
    │ Note: `Atomic<bool>` is moved, never copied: a copy would read it in more than one step, which another thread could see half of
────╯
